        type: type-ref #30 2341:52:9-2344:52:12 name="Int"
      field: field-decl #33 2552:55:3-2584:56:1 name="options" doc="The options it was opened with: `timeout_ms` is the time of each call, and `max_body_bytes` the largest request\nbody. A `proxy` has no user info here, so printing a connection shows no password."
        type: type-ref #32 2561:55:12-2583:55:34 name="HttpWire.ClientOptions"
      field: field-decl #36 2780:58:3-2803:59:1 name="login" doc="The `Proxy-Authorization` value of the proxy's user info (\"\" with none), alone in a channel that holds one value:\na channel prints as `<Channel>`, where a field would print the login."
